> Compare validation likelihoods

Teacher-forced likelihood evaluates each prediction with the true prefix.
Exact match requires the free-running model to generate every correct
digit and EOS. For the plain decoder, validation NLL falls from 2.420 to 2.053 for reversal and
from 2.242 to 1.834 for addition. Both plain models get zero of 32 held-out
sequences exactly right under free-running decoding.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/seq2seq_toys_likelihood.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>

int main() {
  const std::vector<double> epochs{1, 2, 3};
  auto plot = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
  const std::array<dm::graphics::RGB,6> colors{{{37,99,235},{234,88,12},{5,125,99},
      {144,65,188},{180,62,85},{72,120,145}}};
  std::size_t series=0;
  for (const auto& [name, values] : dm::nn::load_npz("build/seq2seq_toys/history.npz")) {
    const auto color = colors.at(series++);
    plot.lines(epochs, values.to_vector<double>(), name, color);
    plot.points(epochs, values.to_vector<double>(), name, color, 4);
  }
  const auto path = "build/seq2seq_toys/likelihood.svg";
  plot.title("Teacher-forced validation likelihood").x_label("Epoch")
      .y_label("Nats per valid token").save_svg(path);
  std::filesystem::create_directories("figures");
  std::filesystem::copy_file(path, "figures/seq2seq_toys_likelihood.svg",
                             std::filesystem::copy_options::overwrite_existing);
}
